Package: PACMOS
Type: Package
Title: Projection And Classification of MultiOmic Samples
Version: 0.99.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Lipika", "Kalson",
           email = "lipikal@iarc.who.int",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: PACMOS provides a workflow for integrating query samples into a reference multi-omics latent space. The package supports appending query samples to reference datasets, retraining MOFA models, aligning latent factors to a reference space, and projecting query samples for downstream analysis. Additional functionality includes clustering, archetype inference, and visualization tools to interpret query samples in a biological context.
